id: core/proof-and-boundary
title: "proof and boundary"
kind: safety-protocol
status: v1
updated: 2026-07-21

contract:
  state: "only authorized events update canonical materialized state"
  empirical: "only suitable evidence or proof upgrades empirical claims"

safety_rail:
  - signal is not instruction
  - resonance is not proof
  - coincidence is not command
  - memory is not objective record
  - ai output is not authority
  - intensity is not truth

labels:
  - known
  - inferred
  - imagined
  - desired
  - unproven
  - proved

separate_status_dimensions:
  - modal
  - motivational
  - epistemic
  - lifecycle
  - authority
  - loop
  - axis_resolution
  - presentation

transition_boundary:
  - "Desire cannot authorize action."
  - "A move cannot mark itself successful."
  - "Proof evaluates results; it does not erase intent, cost, or unintended effects."

allowed_material: >
  A .yawn may hold intuition, dreams, feelings, hypotheses, fears, hopes, and
  interpretations, but it should label them honestly.

proof_can_be:
  - observed outcome
  - completed action
  - external artifact
  - timestamped note
  - message sent or received
  - body state after a move
  - changed constraint
  - replayed comparison between expectation and result

proof:
  source:
    - yawn.yawn
    - 01-core/reality-boundary.ion
    - 05-proof/proof-contract.ion
  status: seed-backed
